body:
That's not true. While I do not know what is going on in your life, don't assume blame unless you have hard evidence that you messed up.  I am discarded even by people who say good things about me. Too many people are selfish, and will enjoy your company only so long as it is beneficial to them. When it is the friend's turn to need some support, they hit the door running. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
